      "Тесты: переписать на v1 packages/drive/tests/{Feature,Drive,Uploads,Tenancy,Observability,Providers,WriteGuard}/* и core-тесты, вызывающие drive-пути (grep -rlE \"storages/|resumable-uploads|nodes/[^/]+/(download|versions|move|copy|restore|force)\" packages/core/tests); новые packages/drive/tests/Http: DrivesV1Test, NodesV1Test, NodeEtagRepresentationTest, IfMatchRequiredTest, StaleIfMatchTest, NotModifiedV1Test, StarPropertiesV1Test, FilesV1Test, DirectSignedDownloadTest, QuarantinedDownloadTest, PreviewerCannotDownloadTest, TrashV1Test, UploadsV1Test, CacheHeadersDriveV1Test, UniformNotFoundDriveV1Test; packages/drive/tests/Arch/HttpV1ArchTest.php. V36 доказывается последовательным StaleIfMatchTest на SQLite.",
      "Docs: docs/reference/rest-api.md (+ru) — разделы drive/files/trash/uploads; docs/guide/drive.md, uploads.md, trash.md, search-trash.md (+ru); docs/reference/concurrency.md (+ru) — ETag представления узла (D62) вместо \"{id}.{sequence}\", 428, порядок проверок."
    ],
